::begin:EvilDoerAlgorithm:const:69866131668037508298
const: #EvilDoerAlgorithm = Every THOUGHT puts the MIND SUBSTANCE in a certain state of VIBRATION and OPENS the DOOR to the INFLUENCE of such MINDS as are in the same state of VIBRATION. Therefore when we CHERISH EVIL THOUGHTS, we run the DOUBLE RISK of AFFECTING OTHER MINDS and of being INFLUENCED by ALL EVIL MINDED PERSONS HOLDING SIMILAR THOUGHTS, nay, we EXPOSE our MINDS to ALL the EVIL THOUGHTS that have been THOUGHT in the PAST and STORED up in the MENTAL ATMOSPHERE of the WORLD. This is the reason why EVIL DOERS grow WORSE and WORSE every DAY, and get PLACED in the #EvilDoerDungeon with all their #EvilDoerLegalIdentities #EvilDoerFakeIdentities #EvilDoerSharedIdentities #EvilDoerVirtualIdentities #EvilDoerFriends #EvildoerFamiliy #EvilDoerMoney #EvilDoerCryptocurrency #EvilDoerHideouts #EvilDoerCRIMES are LOGGED with ALL their #EvilDoerData and #EvilDoerLogs for #LawfulInvestigation and #LawfulReporting to #LawfulAuthorities. #license:uid:69866131668037508298 #report:62869980647498200358
